<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕsŭvĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m.
		ve and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβε-</span>, root of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβέννυμι</span>; v. Lidd. and Scott s.
		v., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				celebrated volcano in Campania</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 8, 8,
				19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 2,
				4, § 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 3, 2,
				10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 6, 6,
			12</span></i>.—Collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕsēvus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕsaev-</span></b> ),
			i, m., <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Tit. 8</span></i>; id. Vit. Plin.; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4,
				8, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 4, 507</span></i>.—In
			apposition: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vesevo jugo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 224</span></i>
			 (Rib. Vesaevo); <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 3,
				184</span></i>.—Contr. collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vesvĭus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vesbĭus</span></b> , ii,
			m., <i><span class="en">Mart. 4, 44, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4,
				4, 79</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8, 655</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17</span></i>,  598;
				<i><span class="en">Val.
				Fl. 3, 209</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕsŭvī-nus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to Vesuvius</i>, <i>Vesuvian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 3, 5, 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incendia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 6, 62</span></i>
			; 5, 3, 205.—Collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕsēvīnus</span></b> ,
				a, um: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Tard. 2, 1</span></i>
			.—Contr. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vesbīnus</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Sil. 12,
				152</span></i>.</div>
